// cppcheck suppressions, applied by tools/quality_check.py.
// One id per line; say why.

// Headers are found through -I for first-party code only; the system's and
// the fetched dependencies' are left unread on purpose (speed).
missingInclude
missingIncludeSystem

// Fires on every aggregate with a std::string or a span member. The members
// that really are indeterminate are reported by clang-tidy
// (cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-member-init).
uninitMemberVarNoCtor

// An unread dependency leaves a macro or a type unknown; that is not a
// finding about this code.
unknownMacro
checkersReport
